<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Anime Tracker</h1>

  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    Anime Tracker is a community-driven platform for discovering, rating, and tracking anime.
    Users can browse the catalog, cast upvotes or downvotes, share their thoughts in the comments,
    and maintain a personal watch list inspired by MAL and AniList.
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    Built with Ruby on Rails 8, PostgreSQL, and Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus).
    Deployed on Render with a managed Aiven PostgreSQL database.
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    This is a personal project created for learning and experimentation.
    If you spot a bug or have feedback, feel free to reach out.
  </p>
</div>
